{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56355","headline":"恺悌诗（幷序） 良哉二章（一章十句，一章十二句）（良哉，协帝赉也。） 一 · 孙宗闵","name":"恺悌诗（幷序） 良哉二章（一章十句，一章十二句）（良哉，协帝赉也。） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巨望弥耸，其德不回。\n乃眷西顾，赉公贤才。\n帝曰钦往，时称良哉。\n乃邦之彦，实民之怀。\n飞荣骊阙，进秩兰台。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙宗闵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}